{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0193-s001", "text": "Småbarnspedagogik är avsedd för barn under skolåldern.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T012957691380+0000-1/hb-c08-u0193-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.154829931972789, "peak": 0.260498046875, "generation_seconds": 7.792744167149067, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0193-s002", "text": "I Finland tillhandahåller kommunerna kommunal småbarnspedagogik bland annat i daghem.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T012957691380+0000-1/hb-c08-u0193-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.592925170068027, "peak": 0.33087158203125, "generation_seconds": 8.408427278045565, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0193-s003", "text": "Dessutom finns det privata daghem.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T012957691380+0000-1/hb-c08-u0193-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.274013605442177, "peak": 0.299957275390625, "generation_seconds": 3.8710199701599777, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0014-s001", "text": "Småbarnspedagogik är fostran, undervisning och omsorg som är pedagogiskt planerad och som har noga genomtänkta mål.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T012957691380+0000-1/hb-c08-u0014-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.24, "peak": 0.26446533203125, "generation_seconds": 11.555417583091184, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0014-s002", "text": "Inom småbarnspedagogiken arbetar utbildade lärare inom småbarnspedagogik, socionomer och barnskötare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T012957691380+0000-1/hb-c08-u0014-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.125442176870749, "peak": 0.2935791015625, "generation_seconds": 11.17589675099589, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0015-s001", "text": "I Finland har ett barn rätt till småbarnspedagogik från början av den månad då barnet fyller nio månader.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T012957691380+0000-1/hb-c08-u0015-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.986122448979591, "peak": 0.227874755859375, "generation_seconds": 11.599762256024405, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0015-s002", "text": "Vissa föräldrar tar dock hand om barnet längre hemma.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T012957691380+0000-1/hb-c08-u0015-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.085170068027211, "peak": 0.288238525390625, "generation_seconds": 7.686582655180246, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0015-s003", "text": "I genomsnitt börjar barnen inom småbarnspedagogik när de är ett och ett halvt till två år gamla.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T012957691380+0000-1/hb-c08-u0015-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.150204081632653, "peak": 0.339935302734375, "generation_seconds": 10.677099601132795, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
